# There is no backend/.env any more.
#
# The project reads a single Application/.env, beside docker-compose.yml, which
# app/config.py resolves by absolute path so it is found from any working
# directory. This file used to be a second copy of the same secrets with
# nothing keeping the two in step -- and when they drift, the symptom is tokens
# signed with one key and verified with another, which reads to a person as
# being randomly signed out.
#
# Copy Application/.env.example to Application/.env instead.
